      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Gates",
      "items": [
        "password verifies first — one constant 401, retries capped even on gated accounts",
        "state gates in order: inactive → blocked → unverified, each a stable 403",
        "argon2 with an HMAC-SHA256 pepper; rate-limit counters live in Dragonfly with TTLs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Tokens",
      "items": [
